  "description": "Nicole killed the man who she thought destroyed her life: her husband. However, the truth was revealed too late. Given a second chance, she returns to a past where love is not an option and marriage must never happen. To protect the man she once vowed to kill, Nicole must risk everything. But can a love born from regret ever be returned?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
